  "bio": "Andrew C. Elizondo is a highly skilled tattoo artist, specializing in the black & gray and trash polka styles at Solace Tattoo in Elko, NV. Clients appreciate his professionalism in both the creation of stunning tattoo art and the meticulous attention to detail he maintains throughout the tattooing process. Andrew's commitment to providing a clean and safe environment ensures a comfortable and reassuring experience for all his clients.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Elko, Nevada, United States\n\nLiving Solo\nOwner/Artist at Solace Tattoo - Elko, NV\nJerk of Trades @back_alley_builds",
